+> docker run -v "$(pwd):/code" -w /code sokrates init
+
+### Landscape
+
+Create or refresh a landscape report, aggregating the analyses found under an analysis root:
+> java -jar sokrates.jar analyzeLandscape -analysisRoot <folder>
+
+`analyzeLandscape` is the landscape counterpart of the analysis commands. `updateLandscape` is the same command under its older name. Use `-help` after the command name to see its options.
